            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "simplyhis1"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Everyone I make this pie for loves it! It is simple, real ingredients. I like that is doesn't have pudding and cream cheese and such in it. I add half chocolate chips with the peanut butter chips on the crust. I have also used mixed nuts crushed on top instead of all peanuts. Breaks up the all peanut flavor. I think raspberry chips might also be good - kind of like a pbj pie."
          },
